  "initial_contract": "All streams start with empty knowledge. Only anonymous controls, bounds and sensor banks are exposed. A uses96 observations/30000 compute/1152 meter; B uses512/480000/6144. A is focus or event, while B is focus on the same apparatus and wiring with a new trajectory seed. No object partition, hidden formula, source hypothesis or candidate score is supplied.",
  "schedule_contract": "Finish all first visits before scheduled continuations. The shared total pool is exactly the sum of initial allowances. Restore prior purchased transitions, partial role alternatives and recorded experiments from JSON. A later object model can propose additional research, never automatically certify A's roles or response. Every source visit, screen, failed hypothesis and new measurement is charged. Keep roots without an opportunity.",
  "evaluation_contract": "Only after all cohort learning ends, score initial and final programs on identical4x48 random trajectories plus per-anonymous-control low/quarter/mid/three-quarter/high steps at one center and two independently sampled nonzero public-bound backgrounds. Every step sequence includes reset and return history; no true relation radius or role label constructs probes. Anonymous banks are not projectable: purchase each needed legal bank separately, derive commands from actual applied controls, and count all terminal resources. Report deployed initial/final channel costs separately. Both random and sweep MSE must be <=1e-6.",
